38179>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38182>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38182>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38182>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38182>>>        Handle hoDD
38182>>>
38182>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38183>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38184>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38185>>>
38185>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38185>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38186>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38187>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38188>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38189>>>
38189>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
