38192>>>        Else Begin
38193>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38194>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38195>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38196>>>        End
38196>>>>
38196>>>    End_Procedure
